   "sev": "info",
   "sevLabel": "Layout family",
   "title": "Enhanced InScript (kn-inscript2)",
   "body": "<p>A refined InScript variant from the same Wikimedia jQuery.IME family. Differs from plain InScript mainly in edge keys: ZWJ on <code>1</code>, ZWNJ on <code>2</code>, ₹ on <code>4</code> (⌥), and extra conjunct keys (& ಕ್ಷ, * ಶ್ರ, # ರ, % ಜ್ಞ). Same positional base.</p>"
